## Phase 5: AWS ECS Deployment

### 5.1 AWS Resources to Create

| Resource | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| VPC | Network isolation |
| RDS PostgreSQL | Database (db.t4g.micro) |
| ECR (x2) | Container registries |
| ECS Cluster | Fargate containers |
| ALB | Load balancer + SSL termination |
| ACM Certificate | SSL for your domain |
| Route 53 | DNS records |
| Secrets Manager | JWT_SECRET, DB credentials |

### 5.2 Environment Variables (Production)

**Backend:**
```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...@rds-endpoint/astrotask_db
JWT_SECRET=<from-secrets-manager>
ENVIRONMENT=production
CORS_ORIGINS=https://app.yourdomain.com
SECURE_COOKIES=true
COOKIE_DOMAIN=.yourdomain.com
FRONTEND_URL=https://app.yourdomain.com
```

**Frontend (build-time):**
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
```

### 5.3 Domain Setup

Recommended structure:
- `app.yourdomain.com` - Frontend (ECS)
- `api.yourdomain.com` - Backend (ECS)
- Both behind ALB with ACM certificate

